WEBVTT

00:00:28.587 --> 00:00:32.137
In fact, temperate
and tropical rainforests

00:00:32.161 --> 00:00:35.317
each produce a vibrant animal orchestra,

00:00:35.341 --> 00:00:38.545
that instantaneous
and organized expression

00:00:38.569 --> 00:00:43.353
of insects, reptiles,
amphibians, birds and mammals.

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:46.280
And every soundscape
that springs from a wild habitat

00:00:46.304 --> 00:00:49.872
generates its own unique signature,

00:00:49.896 --> 00:00:52.789
one that contains incredible
amounts of information,

00:00:52.813 --> 00:00:57.148
and it's some of that information
I want to share with you today.

00:00:57.172 --> 00:01:00.354
The soundscape is made
up of three basic sources.